- MP3: ID3v2 skip, then parse first frame header for bitrate/samplerate. For CBR estimate: duration = (fileSize - id3) * 8 / bitrate. For VBR skip... approximate. Actually scanning all frames is too heavy for 50MB. Estimate from first frame. Good enough.
- OGG: parse pages, last page granule position / samplerate (from vorbis identification header at beginning). Reading last page requires seeking to end. I can read the last ~64KB.
- M4A: parse moov → mvhd → duration / timescale.

