   - Two file inputs? Or one input accepting both? The user wants both audio and video. Simplest: one form, a file input that accepts both audio and video extensions, and validation decides the limit based on file type (audio→50MB, video→70MB). Also a note "Audio: hasta 50 MB · Video: hasta 70 MB".
